Second or third Valk ascension, about 5th overall.

My previous incarnation was very frustrating after falling in a poison 
spiked pit while looking for poison resistance....
one more try I thought.

Found a magic lamp on level 3 or so, which happened to be blessed. Wished 
for +2 GDSM.
Procured an easy Excalibur.  Also found a bag of holding somewhere in the 
deeper mines.
Not too shabby.

I was able to get quite a collection of potions, scrolls, wands, etc.
Sokoban yielded reflection.

I was able to convert two altars.  Both (plus minetown) were generated 
neutral.  I had always thought that unicorns were necessary to convert 
altars.  I managed to do it with one sacrifice each(leprechan and grey elf I 
think).  After that I was able to bless and identify some essentials.  Got 
Mojo as a gift.  Also managed to pick up a boatload of intrinsics from 
dragons in a zoo.  Got a wish from a throne - speed boots.  Got a genocide 
from another one - disenchanters.
In one of the thronerooms, someone zapped a scroll of create monster - mind 
flayers...  I panicked and genocided "h".

I raided the vaults for about 6 points of protection worth of gold.
Having no means of levetation, I dug down at Medusa's.

At the castle, I took my time.  The lich was very annoying.

The wand yielded:
2 scrolls of charging(got 1)
magic marker
<recharge>
gauntlets of power
cloak of protection

Genocided 'L' and later ';'
No help from armor in the castle...
After taking care of Medusa, I found water walking boots.
I burned another wish for a shield of reflection. Saved the last one.
Able to get the last intrinsic I needed from a blue dragon in the castle.

Went back and did the quest... no problems there.  Found and wore a ring of 
free action the rest of the game.

The demons were especially annoying.  They fled using wands of digging and 
such.
Orcus burned all but one charge of his death wand.  Payed for the rest of my 
protection in the Valley.
I did end up finding another cloak of protection in Orcus town.  Also boots 
of speed in the Wizard tower(and 2 more death wands).
While I was in Orcus town, I used my last wish for another magic marker to 
enchant my stuff.
Along the way picked up a ring of levetation.  I wore the amulet of life 
saving from Vlad's tower for the rest of the game.

Marked the square, went back up, used a wand of digging, followed by a face 
full of sweet,sweet death for the wizard.
He sent in some baddies as soon as I stepped in the sanctum. One was a 
cockatrice, which I used to kill the priests.
I got the mysterious force only once, right after I left the bottommost 
level.  I have never had so few.

Here was the interesting part.  I get to the valley, enter the temple, and 
all of a sudden I am face to face with Demogorgon.
I would love to hear from someone how he appeared.  The FAQ says he must be 
summoned by one of three demons, none of which were on that level.
This was really the only time I was in danger of dying.  Got sick three 
rounds in a row... lousy unicorn horn.  I finally cured myself, backed away, 
and used the E-word.
As he fled, I hit him twice, killing him.

I zipped up through the dungeon, no wizard.
Plane of Earth - facefull of death wand for the wizard again.  Used gold 
detect scroll to find the portal.
Plane of Air - another scroll.  No problems here.
Plane of Fire - someone found the portal for me, I just folled them in.
Plane of Water - again, someone fell through and I followed.
Astral Plane - I took the center with Pestilence.  I zapped him with a death 
wand, also killing a friendly. Oops.  Got zapped.
Center was chaotic, so I tried the right, which was Lawful. Famine touched 
me once.

Learnings
- altars can be converted from ordinary monsters
- I could have used better wishes
- Don't mess with the big D
- Watch where you fling your wand of death

